OL,3,ALula wins fourth term in dramatic
OL,4,ABrazil election comeback
OL,5,
OL,6,FBrazil's President Luiz Inacio Lula da
OL,7,FSilva has won a fourth term in office
OL,8,Fin a dramatic comeback over his
OL,9,Fright-wing challenger Flavio Bolsonaro.
OL,11,FLeft-wing leader Lula took 51.79% of
OL,12,Fvotes, becoming the first president
OL,13,Fsince the return to civilian rule in
OL,14,F1985 to win an election after losing
OL,15,Fthe first round of voting.
OL,17,FLula told celebratory crowds this
OL,18,Felection is a "loss for negativity,
OL,19,Flies", later adding "long live
OL,20,Fdemocracy".
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
