OL,3,ALula wins fourth term in dramatic
OL,4,ABrazil election comeback
OL,5,
OL,6,FFlavio Bolsonaro, who is the son of
OL,7,Fconvicted former president Jair
OL,8,FBolsonaro, has so far refused to
OL,9,Frecognise the result and called for it
OL,10,Fto be annulled, which experts say is
OL,11,Funlikely.
